### 1. Happy path: solvable board, two algorithms
### Expect 200. For now the server echoes the request back.
POST http://localhost:8080/solve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "initialConfiguration": "125340678",
  "algorithms": ["BFS", "ASTAR_MANHATTAN"]
}

### 2. All five algorithms
POST http://localhost:8080/solve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "initialConfiguration": "125340678",
  "algorithms": ["BFS", "DFS", "IDDFS", "ASTAR_MANHATTAN", "ASTAR_EUCLIDEAN"]
}

### 3. CORS preflight
### Expect 204 with Access-Control-Allow-Origin and no body.
OPTIONS http://localhost:8080/solve

### 4. Wrong method
### Expect 405 with {"Error": "..."}
GET http://localhost:8080/solve

### 5. Unknown enum value
### Expect 400 (Jackson InvalidFormatException)
POST http://localhost:8080/solve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "initialConfiguration": "125340678",
  "algorithms": ["BOGUS"]
}

### 6. Malformed JSON (missing closing brace)
### Expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/solve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "initialConfiguration": "125340678",
  "algorithms": ["BFS"]

### 7. Unknown field
### Expect 400 (FAIL_ON_UNKNOWN_PROPERTIES is on by default)
POST http://localhost:8080/solve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "initialConfiguration": "125340678",
  "algorithms": ["BFS"],
  "heuristic": "manhattan"
}

### 8. Unsolvable board (odd inversions)
### Expect 400 once the compact constructor validates solvability
POST http://localhost:8080/solve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "initial": "123456870",
  "algorithms": ["BFS"]
}

### 9. Invalid board (duplicate digit, wrong length)
### Expect 400 once the compact constructor validates
POST http://localhost:8080/solve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "initial": "11234567",
  "algorithms": ["BFS"]
}
